{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/095758e3af41e9dd6742ad4cb693bd46.avif?t=1771344984\" width=790 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a near-future New York City, the subway has fractured into rival districts, each controlled by a Track Titan: a celebrity driver with loyal fans, deep pockets, and total control of their line. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You\u2019re not one of them. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All you have to your name is a rundown train, no reputation, and even less respect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/dd816a322a359ad187a38dffc3045e3c.poster.avif?t=1771344984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/dd816a322a359ad187a38dffc3045e3c.webm?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/dd816a322a359ad187a38dffc3045e3c.mp4?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To rise, you\u2019ll need more than just raw pace. Take on jobs, earn cash, grow your following, and build the prestige required to take these territories for yourself, one line at a time. Play it smart because reckless speed can cost you everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Outmanoeuvre your rivals. Challenge the Titans. Seize their turf.</strong></i><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.poster.avif?t=1771344984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.webm?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.mp4?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>This is racing with consequences. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Metro Rivals is a unique experience blending strategy racing, light simulation, and story-driven progression that rewards players who think ahead more than those who put the pedal to the metal. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3024160?t=1771344984","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/8470e2051653a93bc24f7a59f67e4cc7201d45cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771344984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/569f58b7297a2ff2584054450c9068c17eaf9fa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771344984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/569f58b7297a2ff2584054450c9068c17eaf9fa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771344984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"S