ories for yourself, one line at a time. Play it smart because reckless speed can cost you everything. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Outmanoeuvre your rivals. Challenge the Titans. Seize their turf.</strong></i><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.poster.avif?t=1771344984\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.webm?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/extras/9ca3fd829d10f19a80d6a615eca66779.mp4?t=1771344984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>This is racing with consequences. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Metro Rivals is a unique experience blending strategy racing, light simulation, and story-driven progression that rewards players who think ahead more than those who put the pedal to the metal. </p>","developers":["Dovetail Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024160/be2fdd3ffecb6e84e561d47dcc53effbad54d8c4/header.jpg?t=1771344984","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Dovetail Games, a trading name of RailSimulator.com Limited (\u201cDTG\u201d). \u201cMetro Rivals\u201d and \u201cSimuGraph\u201d are trademarks or registered trademarks of DTG. Unreal\u00ae is a registered trademark or trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 199